 "narr": {
  "Aqua HK": "W33 users 3,936 (+1.0% YoY) with 220 GA4 bookings (+0.9% YoY); conversion rate 5.6% vs 5.6% LY. Google delivered 82 bookings at HK$132 CPA; Meta 16 at HK$408. Google had not fully published modelled store visits for this week when the data was pulled, so the latest point on the walk-in panel understates the true figure.",
  "Hutong HK": "W33 users 4,600 (+46.4% YoY) with 315 GA4 bookings (+25.5% YoY); conversion rate 6.8% vs 8.0% LY. Google delivered 16 bookings at HK$394 CPA; Meta 9 at HK$513. Google had not fully published modelled store visits for this week when the data was pulled, so the latest point on the walk-in panel understates the true figure.",
  "The Chinese Library": "W33 users 1,970 (+41.7% YoY) with 139 GA4 bookings (+14.9% YoY); conversion rate 7.1% vs 8.7% LY. Google delivered 35 bookings at HK$90 CPA; Meta 5 at HK$730. Google had not fully published modelled store visits for this week when the data was pulled, so the latest point on the walk-in panel understates the true figure.",
  "Cantina": "W33 users 1,448 (+35.6% YoY) with 81 GA4 bookings (+65.3% YoY); conversion rate 5.6% vs 4.6% LY. Google delivered 8 bookings at HK$389 CPA; Meta 7 at HK$327. Google had not fully published modelled store visits for this week when the data was pulled, so the latest point on the walk-in panel understates the true figure.",
  "Dim Sum Library": "W33 users 1,292 (+21.7% YoY) with 155 GA4 bookings (-13.9% YoY); conversion rate 12.0% vs 16.9% LY. Google delivered 66 bookings at HK$20 CPA; Meta 6 at HK$174.",
  "Shiro Pacific Place": "W33 users 654 (-20.4% YoY) with 66 GA4 bookings (-38.9% YoY); conversion rate 10.1% vs 13.1% LY. Google delivered 60 bookings at HK$68 CPA; Meta 19 at HK$270. Google had not fully published modelled store visits for this week when the data was pulled, so the latest point on the walk-in panel understates the true figure.",
  "Shiro Tai Kwun": "W33 users 1,441 with 79 GA4 bookings; conversion rate 5.5%. New in 2026, so there is no like-for-like last year. Google delivered 60 bookings at HK$68 CPA; Meta 19 at HK$270. Google had not fully published modelled store visits for this week when the data was pulled, so the latest point on the walk-in panel understates the true figure.",
  "Vesu": "W33 users 1,380 (+60.3% YoY) with 105 GA4 bookings (+61.5% YoY); conversion rate 7.6% vs 7.5% LY. Google delivered 31 bookings at HK$80 CPA; Meta 35 at HK$98 from the conversion campaign. Vesu closed in late April and reopened on 8 September, so W30 and W31 are closed weeks: the ad panels show gaps where no booking campaigns ran (the awareness campaign that ran while closed carries no cost per booking), and the website figures for those weeks are visits and advance bookings made before reopening. W32 had six trading days. Google walk-in signals are not tracked in this account, so that panel is empty.",
  "The Canton Library": "The Canton Library opened on 8 September 2026, so there is no last-year line. W33 users 3,767 with 31 GA4 bookings; conversion rate 0.8%. Meta's conversions campaign delivered 8 bookings at HK$1,559 CPA (schedules tracked only from 10 Sep); the awareness campaign (HK$3,079 this week) optimises to landing page views and carries no cost per booking. Google spent HK$10,894 this week but has no booking conversion recording, so Google bookings and CPA are not available rather than zero. W30 and W31 were pre-opening weeks, shown as gaps."
 },
